				<article class="elementor-post elementor-grid-item post-41394 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-announcements category-news-events category-uncategorized" role="listitem">
			<div class="elementor-post__card">
				<a class="elementor-post__thumbnail__link" href="https://sccc.edu/seward-county-community-college-reports-on-tax-collections/" tabindex="-1" ><div class="elementor-post__thumbnail"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="800" height="305" src="https://sccc.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Half-stack-name-color-copy-1024x390.jpg" class="attachment-large size-large wp-image-41395" alt="" srcset="https://sccc.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Half-stack-name-color-copy-1024x390.jpg 1024w, https://sccc.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Half-stack-name-color-copy-300x114.jpg 300w, https://sccc.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Half-stack-name-color-copy-768x293.jpg 768w, https://sccc.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Half-stack-name-color-copy.jpg 1125w" sizes="(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px" /></div></a>
				<div class="elementor-post__text">
				<h3 class="elementor-post__title">
			<a href="https://sccc.edu/seward-county-community-college-reports-on-tax-collections/" >
				Seward County Community College Reports on Tax Collections			</a>
		</h3>
				<div class="elementor-post__excerpt">
			<p>LIBERAL, Kan. – In the summer, Seward County Community College implemented budget cuts and staffing efficiencies in response to a projected significant decline in property-tax collections. The college received the final tax distribution for the calendar year in October. For the 2025 tax year, the college levied $9,950,473 in property</p>
		</div>
					<div class="elementor-post__read-more-wrapper">
		
		<a class="elementor-post__read-more" href="https://sccc.edu/seward-county-community-college-reports-on-tax-collections/" aria-label="Read more about Seward County Community College Reports on Tax Collections" tabindex="-1" >
			Read More »		</a>

					</div>
				</div>
					</div>
		</article>
				<article class="elementor-post elementor-grid-item post-41329 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-campus category-events category-our-community category-uncategorized" role="listitem">
			<div class="elementor-post__card">
				<a class="elementor-post__thumbnail__link" href="https://sccc.edu/sccc-to-hold-veterans-day-ceremony/" tabindex="-1" ><div class="elementor-post__thumbnail"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="800" height="621" src="https://sccc.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/IMG_8788-e1794318144981-1024x795.png" class="attachment-large size-large wp-image-41330" alt="" srcset="https://sccc.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/IMG_8788-e1794318144981-1024x795.png 1024w, https://sccc.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/IMG_8788-e1794318144981-300x233.png 300w, https://sccc.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/IMG_8788-e1794318144981-768x596.png 768w, https://sccc.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/IMG_8788-e1794318144981.png 1130w" sizes="(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px" /></div></a>
				<div class="elementor-post__text">
				<h3 class="elementor-post__title">
			<a href="https://sccc.edu/sccc-to-hold-veterans-day-ceremony/" >
				SCCC to Hold Veterans Day Ceremony			</a>
		</h3>
				<div class="elementor-post__excerpt">
			<p>LIBERAL, Kan. — Seward County Community College will hold a Veterans Day ceremony at 11 a.m. on Wednesday, November 11, at the flagpole near the Hobble Academic Building. The event is free and open to the public. The ceremony will recognize veterans for their service to the nation. Several veterans</p>
		</div>
					<div class="elementor-post__read-more-wrapper">
		
		<a class="elementor-post__read-more" href="https://sccc.edu/sccc-to-hold-veterans-day-ceremony/" aria-label="Read more about SCCC to Hold Veterans Day Ceremony" tabindex="-1" >
			Read More »		</a>

					</div>
				</div>
					</div>
		</article>
				<article class="elementor-post elementor-grid-item post-41207 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-announcements category-grants category-news-events category-uncategorized category-workforce-development" role="listitem">
			<div class="elementor-post__card">
				<a class="elementor-post__thumbnail__link" href="https://sccc.edu/seward-county-community-college-awarded-125000-grant-to-expand-workforce-education-pathways/" tabindex="-1" ><div class="elementor-post__thumbnail"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="800" height="534" src="https://sccc.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/adult-ed-1024x683.jpg" class="attachment-large size-large wp-image-41208" alt="" srcset="https://sccc.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/adult-ed-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://sccc.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/adult-ed-300x200.jpg 300w, https://sccc.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/adult-ed-768x512.jpg 768w, https://sccc.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/adult-ed-1536x1025.jpg 1536w, https://sccc.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/adult-ed.jpg 2048w" sizes="(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px" /></div></a>
				<div class="elementor-post__text">
				<h3 class="elementor-post__title">
			<a href="https://sccc.edu/seward-county-community-college-awarded-125000-grant-to-expand-workforce-education-pathways/" >
				SCCC Awarded $125,000 Grant to Expand Workforce Education Pathways			</a>
		</h3>
				<div class="elementor-post__excerpt">
			<p>LIBERAL, Kan. — Seward County Community College has received approval for a $125,000 Integrating Academics and Career and Technical Education grant through the Kansas Board of Regents. The funding will support the development of an Integrated Workforce Pathways Hub, an initiative designed to strengthen connections between adult education, technical training,</p>
		</div>
					<div class="elementor-post__read-more-wrapper">
		
		<a class="elementor-post__read-more" href="https://sccc.edu/seward-county-community-college-awarded-125000-grant-to-expand-workforce-education-pathways/" aria-label="Read more about SCCC Awarded $125,000 Grant to Expand Workforce Education Pathways" tabindex="-1" >
			Read More »		</a>

					</div>
				</div>
					</div>
		</article>
				<article class="elementor-post elementor-grid-item post-40974 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-announcements category-grants category-news-events category-service-careers category-uncategorized category-workforce-development" role="listitem">
			<div class="elementor-post__card">
				<a class="elementor-post__thumbnail__link" href="https://sccc.edu/sccc-awarded-2-2-million-grant-to-transform-career-pathways-workforce-training/" tabindex="-1" ><div class="elementor-post__thumbnail"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="800" height="525" src="https://sccc.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/DSC06554-e1791372235550-1024x672.jpg" class="attachment-large size-large wp-image-40975" alt="" srcset="https://sccc.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/DSC06554-e1791372235550-1024x672.jpg 1024w, https://sccc.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/DSC06554-e1791372235550-300x197.jpg 300w, https://sccc.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/DSC06554-e1791372235550-768x504.jpg 768w, https://sccc.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/DSC06554-e1791372235550-1536x1009.jpg 1536w, https://sccc.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/DSC06554-e1791372235550-2048x1345.jpg 2048w" sizes="(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px" /></div></a>
				<div class="elementor-post__text">
				<h3 class="elementor-post__title">
			<a href="https://sccc.edu/sccc-awarded-2-2-million-grant-to-transform-career-pathways-workforce-training/" >
				SCCC awarded $2.2 million grant to transform career pathways, workforce training			</a>
		</h3>
				<div class="elementor-post__excerpt">
			<p>LIBERAL, Kan. — Seward County Community College has been awarded approximately $2.2 million in first-year funding through the U.S. Department of Education’s Title III Strengthening Institutions Program to launch the Southwest Kansas Career Pathways and Institutional Transformation Initiative, a five-year project focused on expanding workforce training, strengthening student success, and</p>
